@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Get seeded teams
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams

### Get seeded requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests

### Add a team
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Южная бригада",
  "capacity": 3,
  "startLatitude": 52.49,
  "startLongitude": 13.40,
  "shiftStartMinute": 480,
  "shiftEndMinute": 1080,
  "active": true
}

### Add a transport request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Срочный вызов",
  "address": "Potsdamer Platz, Berlin",
  "latitude": 52.5096,
  "longitude": 13.3759,
  "windowStartMinute": 600,
  "windowEndMinute": 720,
  "serviceDurationMinutes": 30,
  "demand": 1
}

### Optimize all NEW and PLANNED requests
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dispatch/optimize
